al understanding and real-world readiness.\n\nLearners can safely practice essential ventilation principles, visualize system behavior, and build confidence before applying their skills in actual HVAC settings.", "short_description": "Explore core HVAC ventilation concepts through immersive VR training. This application is part of the ImmerseLearn HVAC Ventilation Principles micro-credential program and is designed for enrolled learners only. Gain hands-on experience with airflow, duct systems, and ventilation fundamentals in a safe, interactive environment."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://immerselearn.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ImmerseLearn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://immerselearn.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "35324512830529594"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491818852_854020717042991_7689257426607531633_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ycqFTPi1Bt8Q7kNvwFMGxaZ&_nc_oc=Adq7qhDfbV45YdPp45iqWmBeYsj03I5ifO0kTLvgSbBAQ1RYirvrIeGEWDpbrVE7ZL0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_ct8HgE1Y_qSx5JtTy6uVXSXe-Hlrr3fWYS1ugP_MnwA&oe=6A3012F5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_of